        },
        "faq_item_3": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Is this an ebook or a printed book?",
            "answer": "<p>An ebook. You get a PDF and an EPUB file by email straight after you pay, and you can read them on any phone, tablet, computer or e-reader.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_4": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What is the difference between the editions?",
            "answer": "<p>The ebook is the book. Ebook and audiobook adds the full audio, read by Tess. The complete set adds thirty printable training cards as well.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_5": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "My puppy is driving me mad right now. Where do I start?",
            "answer": "<p>Start with chapter twelve, biting, chewing and jumping up, then look up your problem in the index. Most fixes start with more sleep and shorter sessions.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_6": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What age is it for?",
            "answer": "<p>Puppies from eight weeks, and young or rescue dogs up to about two years. If your dog shows aggression or serious fear, see a qualified behaviourist in person.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
